WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:05.440
You're on your way to the future.

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:07.530
The future?

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:08.360
But what about you?

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:12.770
Dio is waiting, Aoba.

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:15.320
Hina...

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.120
Spread your wings

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:28.750
See the light of hope in the sky you have yet to witness

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.050
And don't ever give in to the weight of sorrow

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:37.430
Echo unto eternity, "Unisonia"

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:46.650
That world you see before your eyes

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:52.230
I wonder what colors it is made of

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.700
The pain of loss isn't something

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:59.660
You want to get used to, and yet

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:04.620
Even on a night like this, the stars glisten

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:11.590
Like a tarnished coin spilling from the palm of your hand

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.420
Can't go back

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:14.840
Want to go home

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:18.220
The two of them back-to-back

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:20.260
Break through

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:24.980
Turning unfading emotions into a lasting bond

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:28.310
Like painting over a colorless world

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:31.020
Let this sympathy reach

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:37.280
Let's build the future that we envision

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.490
You'll see, we'll even change fate

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:45.290
Transcending time, "Unisonia"

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.100
Six enemy Valiancer units from the Zogilian army.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:03.280
Floating battleship Zuiho and defense unit are
engaging them but are suffering heavy damage.

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.160
Supplies on C-level are to be prioritized for later!

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.540
Prioritize fuel, ammunition and food!

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:10.650
Oh, my.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:13.290
To be attacked during loading work...

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:14.860
How long until we can take off?

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:16.610
Just three more gauges to load.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:19.740
Battleship Valiancer unit, please prepare for battle.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.570
This is Lieutenant Conrad.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:24.290
Requesting permission for Dio's Bradyon to take off.

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:24.990
Captain.

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:31.170
Luxon is unavailable for combat.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:33.130
Dio, are you okay?

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:33.920
Yeah.

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:35.540
This is for Marcus's sake.

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:37.480
With the three of us together, we'll manage.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:39.800
The enemy is probably targeting Dio's mecha.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.760
Would the brass approve?

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.640
Lieutenant, Bradyon is cleared for takeoff.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:48.390
But the captain says to exercise caution and to avoid capture at all costs.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:51.200
They're giving you one more thing to worry about, Dio Weinberg.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.730
That's enough, Jarl.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.260
Carelessness will cost you.

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:57.120
If you value your life, then follow my lead.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:57.780
Let's go!

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.950
Yes, sir!

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.640
Is that all they've got?

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:09.540
It's almost funny, Bizon.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:13.660
Tarjim, our objective is not to defeat the enemy.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:16.280
Keep your eye out for any suspicious units.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.880
Bizon, they've sent out reinforcements.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:21.880
You three, follow me.

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.390
Yes, sir.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.100
We'll strike the enemy first once we're clear of the smoke.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.330
Withdraw before they have a chance to react.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:34.020
Understood.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:35.780
It's the enemy.

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:36.190
What?

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.070
Just as Bizon expected.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:41.780
There is no data. It's probably a new type of mecha.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.490
So that's the one.

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:45.330
Benesh and Assop, take care of the Beryls.

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.620
Lasha and Mihailov, deal with the new type.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.050
Tarjim and I will handle the flagship.

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:52.080
All mechas stay alert.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.460
Yes, sir!

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:05.260
How is it, Lasha?

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.360
It's stronger than a Beryl, but I should be able to take it down.

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.890
Capture it, if possible.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:10.690
Yes, sir.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.360
I can't lose it.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:25.610
Who's there?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.660
Nice Coupling.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:37.750
Luxon reports a "Nice Coupling" response with Dio's Bradyon.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:38.540
What?

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:39.340
Eh?

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:40.550
What the...?

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.250
That's impossible.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.390
Is Marcus-san piloting it?

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:50.850
Marcus's vital signs ceased 20 minutes ago.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:53.730
In the first place, the hatch was buried shut by all the rubble.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:54.890
Can you check inside?

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.560
No, the camera's malfunctioning.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:00.180
This is Lieutenant Commander Lene Kleinbeck.

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.860
State your name and unit.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.330
Who's that? Hina?

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:05.360
This voice is...

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:06.910
Hina?

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:09.870
Is that you, Hina? Where am I?

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.330
Your name and unit?

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:14.040
This isn't Hina...

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.420
I'm a freshman at Seiou Highschool,

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.880
Watase Aoba.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:19.630
Watase Aoba?

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.560
Is he a member of the research laboratory?

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:23.460
Anyway, it's dangerous there.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.510
Get to the front of the cargo elevator.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.720
How am I supposed to move?

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.970
Don't tell me you don't even have a Category A?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.720
It's against army regulations to pilot without a license.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:33.970
Get out of the unit at once.

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:36.230
Get out? How?

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.310
You'll face your punishment after this battle.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.320
Stay put until then.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:47.080
Three of our Nectar cannons have been damaged.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:49.250
We've only three units left capable of deploying a smokescreen.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.330
What about the Valiancers?

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:51.570
Bradyon is engaging with two units.

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:53.370
Beryl A & C are each engaging one unit.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:54.910
All units are currently engaged in battle.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.870
Mayu-chan, repeat what you just said.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.980
Um, Luxon reported a "Nice Coupling" response with Bradyon.

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:03.460
Right.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.970
Have both mechas pair together.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.010
Captain?

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.520
The situation looks grim.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:14.470
Luxon is defenseless. At this rate,
it'll be captured in no time.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.180
If he can share Dio's ability,

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:20.480
even a beginner should be able to reach the elevator.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:24.230
You want Dio to couple with some stranger?

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:26.030
It's indicating a perfect match, is it not?

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:28.640
Yes, but...

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.880
Not to mention that we'd be
compromising classified information.

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:33.370
I'll take full responsibility.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:37.330
Abandoning Luxon would be a danger to us all.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:41.080
And I'm not very fond of losing.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.910
You know me, Lieutenant Commander.

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:52.340
Initiate the coupling process for Luxon and Bradyon.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:53.180
Roger!

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.930
But Lieutenant Commander Lene!

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.980
This is a direct order from the commander.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:02.400
Roger.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:03.860
Can you hear me?

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:07.020
I'm going to be Coupling with you.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:08.240
"Coupling"?

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:11.110
Just do as I say.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:17.120
What's with him?

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:25.710
Seriously?

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:37.930
Just one more push.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.140
Hey, there's another mecha.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.440
I'll take care of it.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.060
Hold on.

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:45.360
Mihailov, you take care of it.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.820
Tarjim, get back into position.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:47.950
Yes, sir.

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.570
I'm dying of boredom, Bizon.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:52.780
They've found him.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.450
Damn it, I'll stop them!

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:58.790
Can you hear me? Say, "Connect with Dio."

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.790
Bradyon, you are within range of the Seventh Code coverage.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:02.870
Roger.

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:07.090
Should I back him up?

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:11.340
Co-Connect?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.680
Connect! Connect with Dio!

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:14.970
Dio?

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:16.930
Dio is waiting.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.430
Yes, connect with Dio!

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:20.140
Are you Dio?

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.140
What?

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.820
Dio, I'm Watase Aoba.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.900
Hina said you were waiting for me.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:42.040
Dio, what's wrong? You're almost out of range.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.580
Hurry up and start the Proposing.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.630
Just do as I say, Watase Aoba!

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:48.840
Understood.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:52.760
He's going there as well?

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:55.470
Mihailov, open fire from there.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.550
Yes, sir.

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:03.140
You hear me?

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.890
Say, "Connect with Dio."

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:07.350
Connect with Dio!

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.400
Accept!

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.900
Linkage has started.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:13.530
First Proposing!

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:51.060
Did that do it?

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:55.530
What?

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:03.700
What's going on?

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:04.950
They've transformed?

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.380
Coupling...

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.920
Is a success.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.260
They're at maximum compatibility!

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:28.770
Get ready.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:36.780
What?

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:37.650
It's fast!

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:48.250
Our Coupling was a success.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.410
Seriously?

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:50.850
It's amazing.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:53.000
How can his compatibility with me be this high?

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:59.290
Did I activate it?

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:04.140
That's correct. You are currently sharing Dio's
knowledge of how to operate the robot through Coupling.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:05.260
Sharing?

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:08.860
You're now capable of piloting a Valiancer.

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:10.000
The enemy is closing in.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:10.770
Enemy?

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:22.320
This...

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.620
What is this?

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:35.420
No time to daydream!

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:45.140
It moved!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:54.730
Shit!

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.940
You!

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.230
Such power!

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.740
Bradyon's performance has nearly doubled.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.320
Is Coupling really this effective?

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:08.730
More importantly, the one that couldn't
even walk is putting up a good fight now.

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:10.660
Did the Coupling do this too?

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:13.000
No. He's not normal.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.420
These numbers are off the charts.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:20.010
You're a mere Valiancer.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.600
Dammit!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:38.650
I'm flying.

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:41.530
You wish!

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:43.450
I see it!

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:48.120
This again?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.410
All right.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:08.090
Mihailov!

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:09.300
He did it?

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:10.830
How dare you!

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:12.970
I won't let you!

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:13.840
Shit.

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:17.310
My left arm has been destroyed. I'm falling back.

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:19.980
All units, retreat.

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:22.230
We got to see their new mecha.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:24.600
Any further losses would be pointless.

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:25.740
Roger.

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.760
Hey, hey, you kidding me, Bizon?

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:36.710
I just finished bringing this one down.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:39.290
Hurry up, Tarjim. We'll leave you if you don't.

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:40.790
Yes, sir!

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:46.590
All enemy units are retreating.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.720
All Valiancer units, return to ship.

00:13:55.340 --> 00:13:59.440
If the enemy attacked from the south,
they could've easily sent in reinforcements.

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.200
Looks like we're going to be busy for a while.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:02.320
Captain,

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.820
what should we do about Luxon's pilot?

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.610
We don't have much of a choice.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.570
Besides, we can't use this hideout anymore.

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.200
Mayu, come with me.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.040
Okay.

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:23.250
Is it over?

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:31.390
Decoupling.

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:40.030
What's happening?

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.620
All personnel! Load the cargo as quickly as possible!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.580
All units are clear...

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:10.480
He's still inside the unit?

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:12.600
He probably doesn't know how to get out.

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:15.600
Hey, what's going on in there?

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:17.470
Dio?

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:21.370
How do you open this?

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:23.520
Maybe here?

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:30.700
That worked.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.240
What a relief.

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:36.830
Who are you?

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:41.700
Running a research laboratory in a
covert location sure backfired, huh?

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:44.830
And not to mention that we lost one of our Couplers.

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:47.640
A tactical withdrawal is in order.

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:48.710
You're right.

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:54.120
It would be impossible to send you
reinforcements without drawing enemy attention.

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:56.470
Head back to the main base immediately.

00:15:56.860 --> 00:16:00.230
And be sure to leave no traces of the incident.

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:01.000
All right.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:04.230
For that matter, what of the new candidate I reported on?

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:06.580
I said leave no traces behind.

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.230
Understood.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:15.160
2088?

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.410
That's right.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.660
What do you mean there's a war going on?

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.450
What about it?

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:21.410
Uh, well...

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.350
Where should I start?

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:31.970
Japan is presently a member of the
Confederate Treaty of Liberty Alliance,

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:33.780
which this battleship belongs to.

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:37.810
Two years ago, war broke out with the Great Zogilia Republic,

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:40.560
and as you can see, the tide of battle is currently against us.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:43.100
Do you follow?

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.930
Is this really the future?

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:46.560
What?

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:51.360
Vice Commander, this guy claims that he came from the past.

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:53.570
It's true, Dio.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.570
Don't say my name like you know me.

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:56.780
But you <i>are</i> Dio, right?

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:59.030
You don't have the right to call me that.

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.990
Hina said that…

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.660
Stop pointing your gun at me!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:07.640
Not until you tell me the truth.
What's with this "I'm from 70 years in the past" crap?

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:09.670
It's like I said. I'm not lying!

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:11.130
Stop it, the both of you.

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:13.130
Dio, lower your weapon.

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:17.140
Vice Commander, I have a message from the captain.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:21.140
Officer Hill and Ensign Weinberg
are to report to his office.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.210
Got it. Thank you.

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:24.520
Ensign Weinberg.

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:25.350
Got it.

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:28.770
Wait a minute. Hey, Dio!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:34.990
There's a girl named Yumihara Hina who has long hair and wears this hairpin.

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:40.370
She was the one who said that...

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:42.130
I don't know any Hina.

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:56.720
Mihailov's noble sacrifice has taken us one step closer to success.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:18:04.720
The Confederate Treaty of Liberty Alliance's secret weapon was hidden away with several dummies,

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:08.310
but you all managed to uncover it.

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:13.520
The Administration Bureau has
demanded a sample of this new machine.

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:17.200
I presume you can get your hands on
one soon, Lieutenant Colonel Alfried?

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.530
But of course, Secret Service Officer.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:22.990
I expect results.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.080
All hail Zogilia.

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:29.250
So, what's his story?

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:33.240
All of his possessions match items dating back to over 70 years ago.

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:38.260
That being said, his story isn't very convincing, and it could just be an elaborate setup.

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:41.010
After all, we're talking about time travel here.

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:43.220
Well, it sure is far-fetched.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:45.010
What about his punishment?

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:50.410
He did save us, but he knows too much.

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:52.940
We'll have to take him back with us to the main base.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:54.980
A sound judgment.

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:56.230
Where is he now?

00:18:56.230 --> 00:19:00.260
Lieutenant Conrad is keeping him in his
room until we decide what to do with him.

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:02.370
Lee's going off on his own again...

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.580
Don't worry. This is a ship.

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:07.370
He also put a tracker on him,
so there's no need to detain him.

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:11.380
It'll be a bit of a shock if he's confined to his room.

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:14.960
Captain, you're going to send him out again?

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:19.300
You don't want me to? He was your Coupling buddy, after all.

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:21.100
That was an emergency.

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:22.760
There won't be a second time with him.

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:27.060
Well, let's pray that that second chance never comes.

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:28.890
Please get ready.

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:31.390
Cygnus will be dispatched towards the North American base.

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:32.390
Yes, sir.

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:35.400
They said you can hold on to these.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:36.920
Thank you.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:42.030
Are you okay?

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.620
You're anything but okay.

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:47.990
Here.

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:50.240
Eat up and relax.

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:51.620
Thanks.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:54.380
Dispatch in 15 minutes.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:55.380
I've gotta head back.

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:00.550
You.

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:03.380
Push this to open the door.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.620
This place is huge, so try not to get lost.

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:07.430
All right.

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:08.550
See you.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:12.890
What's going on?

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:18.610
Did I really travel to the future?

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.570
Did everything happen as you predicted, Hina?

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:24.530
<i>You're going to the future now.</i>

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:26.160
<i>Dio is waiting.</i>

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:31.040
He wasn't waiting at all.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.840
Ogi, status?

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.380
We are currently surfacing.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.130
No enemy units in sight.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:50.010
We're still unsure about the new machines's
potential. Don't let your guard down.

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:51.450
Understood.

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:56.350
Engines, OK.

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:57.730
Navigation, ready.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:20:59.520
Fusion of information, done.

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.780
FCS is all okay.

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:03.820
Captain.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:04.740
Mm-hmm.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:08.200
Cygnus, lift off.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.500
What the... we're moving?

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:04.130
Let's pray that this plan succeeds.

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:14.600
Death to the enemies of Zogilia.

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:19.010
With my heart, I call out

00:22:19.010 --> 00:22:23.390
To the far side, mutually drawn

00:22:23.390 --> 00:22:27.900
Forgetting even the reason I ache

00:22:27.900 --> 00:22:32.530
Just for now, please

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:36.700
I know you

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:41.200
I'm searching for you

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:43.660
Softly pressing my lips

00:22:43.660 --> 00:22:50.300
to the bright afterimage I can't keep from leaving

00:22:50.300 --> 00:22:58.850
If hesitation is what gives way to the slightest of hopes

00:22:58.850 --> 00:23:03.430
To the many gentle mornings...

00:23:03.430 --> 00:23:07.980
and the times I have wondered

00:23:07.980 --> 00:23:12.230
In the future that leads back to that sky,

00:23:12.230 --> 00:23:14.490
I want to save you,

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:16.570
I want to protect you

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:20.950
In the future that arrives at that dream

00:23:20.950 --> 00:23:23.830
Wait for me

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:28.580
The love we'll surely find

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:33.380
I want you to reach out for it

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:38.290
Next episode, on Buddy Complex:

00:23:38.780 --> 00:23:39.850
"Meeting Again."
